    h1 Cancer
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/cancer/symptoms-causes/syc-20370588") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Cancer refers to any one of a large number of diseases characterized by the development of abnormal cells that divide uncontrollably and have the ability to infiltrate and destroy normal body tissue. Cancer often has the ability to spread throughout your body.

